      "text": "Company-building is more about tactics than strategy.\n\nStrategy seems easier to apply because it simplifies complex dynamics.\n\nBut, tactics are more predictive for success than strategy. Being great at recruiting and building product usually overcomes even the worst strategy.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1221566887617650688"
