      "text": "There's nothing quite like the magic of a small team, perfectly aligned in accomplishing the slightly impossible.\n\nIt is electrifying, inspiring, and surprising every time.\n\nDon't take this magic for granted if you're on such a team today. It is very rare—most never experience it",
