        "reply_count": 10,
        "retweet_count": 76
      },
      "text": "Super interesting cognitive bias from Kanneman's work:\n\nWhen all the options are good, people are risk-averse.\n\nWhen all the options are bad, people are **risk-seeking**.\n\nIt's when people are backed into tough situations that so much value ends up being created (pivots, etc.)",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1215454502981009408"
