      "text": "Annoying local maximum of planes:\n\nBecause airlines charge for checked baggage, the \"human\" cabin of airplanes is always crammed, while the cargo cabin likely has lots of space.\n\nThe crammed-ness drives more checked baggage, a meaningful revenue src.\n\nNot globally optimal at all!",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1214020236388765696"
